        <dc:title>The Infinite Wisdom</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Estes, Danny C." opf:role="aut">Estes, Danny C.</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2018-09-23T21:28:38.265602+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>Braxton Snow, P.I., big city arctic wolf, is back! While escaping the glacial clan of his birth, Braxton lands in a sinister genetic laboratory established by the hairless apes long ago. With the help of his new allies, Braxton navigates this alien technology to find his jackrabbit fiancée. But the curious archaeologist red fox has nailed all their coffins by pushing buttons he shouldn't. They know where the hairless apes went now--somewhere the animals should not have followed! Will they ever return home?</dc:description>
